## Assumptions 
- knows how to spread the peanut butter and jelly. 
- knows what peanut butter is.
- knows what jelly is.
- knows where all the items are located. 
- knows how to read instructions .
- knows what a completed sandwhich looks like.

## Steps
- take out bread from the container 
- open the peanut butter 
- spread the peanut butter on one slice of bread with a spoon
- close peanut butter 
- open jelly container
- spread jelly using the spoon on another slice of bread without peanut butter on it
- close jelly jar
- put the two slices together for a completed sandwhich

## Done When
- we have a fully eatable peanut butter and jelly sandwhich, not a sloppy mess with food everywhere. 